  "Not promoted to the default: attention_shard stays False. The flag changes arithmetic (each rank's attention output becomes a partial) and also reaches the captured decode graph, so promotion needs the production-profile mean/tail/max KL, top-1 by category, determinism and task gates over a decode trajectory, which have not been run. The replicated route remains the default and the registered fallback.",
